WEBVTT

00:01:50.811 --> 00:01:52.022
"You're dead, Baki!"

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:54.024
"I'm coming for you!"

00:01:54.048 --> 00:01:57.527
"Die, Baki!"

00:01:57.551 --> 00:01:59.029
Baki...

00:01:59.053 --> 00:02:01.097
Hanma Baki...

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:07.070
I have NO idea where he is
or what he's up to now...

00:02:07.094 --> 00:02:14.577
Things sure have gotten quiet
around here since he up and left...

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.467
Baki...

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:24.134
Him

00:02:30.584 --> 00:02:36.232
When I first met him,
I noticed his eyes...

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:39.636
He had this glare of
a hunger for something...

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:43.073
No other kid's ever had that look...

00:02:43.097 --> 00:02:47.544
I wanted to know him.
I wanted to be there for him.

00:02:47.568 --> 00:02:51.014
With those eyes of his...

00:02:51.038 --> 00:02:56.135
But all he did was fight
without ea yin' a thing!

00:03:05.719 --> 00:03:09.265
--The rumors were true, Kido-san.
--Yeah...

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:11.134
But what's going on?

00:03:11.158 --> 00:03:13.603
Is some kid planning a suicide run?

00:03:13.627 --> 00:03:16.272
Just be quiet, novice.

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:17.821
Yes, sir...

00:03:21.635 --> 00:03:23.660
He's here?!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.230
--He's alone!
--Thinks he's so badass!

00:03:40.254 --> 00:03:42.599
Baki!

00:03:42.623 --> 00:03:45.320
Bring it on! Or are you afraid?!

00:04:11.552 --> 00:04:13.020
Naito-san!

00:04:15.222 --> 00:04:16.917
Why, you...!

00:04:18.292 --> 00:04:22.525
Think you're tough, huh?!
I'll cut you in two, you little--

00:04:25.232 --> 00:04:26.393
Idiot...!

00:04:30.237 --> 00:04:32.182
Kitazawa-san!

00:04:32.206 --> 00:04:35.818
He was strong. Really strong!

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:40.223
The stronger the opponents,
the happier Baki challenged them!

00:04:40.247 --> 00:04:43.683
Even if it was 100 people!

00:04:51.258 --> 00:04:52.335
You little runt!

00:04:52.359 --> 00:04:54.555
--He's strong!
--Attack him all at once!

00:04:55.929 --> 00:04:57.328
Fools.

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:01.377
We're on the same side!

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:04.047
--You brat!
--How dare you...!

00:05:04.071 --> 00:05:08.084
Only four people can
attack him at once. Smart.

00:05:08.108 --> 00:05:12.136
But Kido-san! 100 guys
is no laughing matter!

00:05:14.948 --> 00:05:16.313
Kido-san!

00:05:36.637 --> 00:05:38.127
Got 'im!

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:53.249
--He's gettin' away!
--After him!

00:06:07.267 --> 00:06:09.812
Kido-san! Shouldn't we stop them?!

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:13.670
--I don't want any more false teeth.
--Kido-san!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.921
That's it, huh?

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:39.842
Hey, you! What's going on here?!

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:42.665
--Crap! It's Kido!
--Let's get outta here!

00:06:45.672 --> 00:06:49.552
It's past your bedtime, kiddo!
Run on home!

00:06:49.576 --> 00:06:52.102
You're just going to let them leave?!

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:56.715
Hey, Baki.

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:04.587
Kido-san!

00:07:05.926 --> 00:07:08.338
--Oh, it's you...
--Kido-san!

00:07:08.362 --> 00:07:11.525
You're under arrest
for assaulting an officer!

00:07:18.939 --> 00:07:21.351
That makes five.

00:07:21.375 --> 00:07:25.278
Not another dentist appointment.
Gimme a break, here.

00:07:28.248 --> 00:07:31.828
--Kido-san...
-I'm alright.

00:07:31.852 --> 00:07:34.831
Baki. You lost.

00:07:34.855 --> 00:07:39.202
You only creamed about--

00:07:39.226 --> 00:07:45.007
I never did figure out
why he had that glare...

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:47.796
He just kept gettin' hurt...

00:07:52.706 --> 00:07:57.007
Aw, man. Only 37?

00:07:58.812 --> 00:08:02.112
| was hoping for at least 50...

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:08.564
Kids eager to fight usually
get scars to show other people...

00:08:08.588 --> 00:08:15.905
You could even call 'em
cries for attention...

00:08:15.929 --> 00:08:18.074
But not him.

00:08:18.098 --> 00:08:21.444
He got scars, but never
showed 'em to anyone.

00:08:21.468 --> 00:08:25.681
I'd wager he never even
showed his old lady.

00:08:25.705 --> 00:08:30.233
Come to think of it,
she was pretty hot stuff...!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.755
--Mom...!
--She's your mom?!

00:09:01.975 --> 00:09:04.535
I've decided to do things my own way.

00:09:06.246 --> 00:09:08.925
Now I can do things how { want,

00:09:08.949 --> 00:09:11.461
and I'm not going back to your gym!

00:09:11.485 --> 00:09:14.386
Even if everything IS top-quality,
I still--

00:09:24.798 --> 00:09:27.631
Grow strong, Baki.

00:09:30.837 --> 00:09:34.569
Grow even stronger, like your father.

00:09:48.021 --> 00:09:52.869
Learning that his old lady
was Akezawa Group's leader,

00:09:52.893 --> 00:09:56.305
Akezawa Emi, was a heck of a shock.

00:09:56.329 --> 00:10:00.743
And when I saw on the news that
she died of a mystery illness...

00:10:00.767 --> 00:10:06.649
He vanished at exactly the same time,
so I figured something was up,

00:10:06.673 --> 00:10:11.577
but I had no way to check into it;
I'm just a flatfoot.

00:10:12.412 --> 00:10:19.648
What're you up to, Baki?
Will we ever meet again?

00:10:21.655 --> 00:10:23.833
Baki--

00:10:23.857 --> 00:10:30.285
My name is Kuriyagawa.
Might you be Kido-san?

00:10:31.498 --> 00:10:32.988
Yeah...

00:10:35.602 --> 00:10:40.349
| see. So you ARE Detective Kido.

00:10:40.373 --> 00:10:45.354
Master Baki spoke of you. He referred
to you as "the annoying cop.”

00:10:45.378 --> 00:10:50.760
--$0, you're Akezawa Emi's--
--Yes. I worked for her.

00:10:50.784 --> 00:10:53.829
- I got something to ask you.
--Yes?

00:10:53.853 --> 00:10:58.868
About Baki. What's he up to now?
Where is he?

00:10:58.892 --> 00:11:04.774
--I don't know, either.
--What on earth happened to him?!

00:11:04.798 --> 00:11:05.575
It's--

00:11:05.599 --> 00:11:10.264
Please! Tell me! Why'd he disappear?!

00:11:12.005 --> 00:11:13.683
Very well.

00:11:13.707 --> 00:11:17.486
Master Baki fought a certain man.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:20.890
His father, Mr. Hanma Yujiro.

00:11:20.914 --> 00:11:24.160
To earn a bond with his mother.

00:11:24.184 --> 00:11:26.676
A bond with his mother...?

00:11:39.299 --> 00:11:41.344
A bond with his mother.

00:11:41.368 --> 00:11:47.817
In the 13 years Master Baki has lived,
his constant fights to get stronger

00:11:47.841 --> 00:11:53.389
was to fulfill his mother's desire for
him to grow strong like his father...

00:11:53.413 --> 00:11:58.527
It was undoubtedly to
gain his mother's love.

00:11:58.551 --> 00:11:59.929
Seriously...?

00:11:59.953 --> 00:12:04.734
It was tough on me, as well...
but it's a fact.

00:12:04.758 --> 00:12:10.206
She never noticed him at all;
only Mr. Yujiro...

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:14.510
I'll use anything I have to!

00:12:14.534 --> 00:12:19.115
Even my own child!
That's how crazy I am for him!

00:12:19.139 --> 00:12:24.487
A mother-son bond? Ha!
Get real! Who cares about that?!

00:12:24.511 --> 00:12:27.690
Hanma Yujiro is the
world's greatest man!

00:12:27.714 --> 00:12:31.173
Everything is meaningless before him!

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:41.170
Why? Why won't he
fall in love with me?!

00:12:41.194 --> 00:12:44.926
Do I have no womanly charm?!

00:12:48.134 --> 00:12:49.659
Mom...

00:12:52.238 --> 00:12:57.119
Because you're weak!
It's because you're so weak!

00:12:57.143 --> 00:13:04.260
It's your fault! Why did
I have such a weak child?!

00:13:04.284 --> 00:13:11.400
How can-- How can anyone do
that to a 13-year old kid?!

00:13:11.424 --> 00:13:14.737
That's just... too much...!

00:13:14.761 --> 00:13:18.074
And then he fought him.

00:13:18.098 --> 00:13:21.193
His father, Hanma Yujiro.

00:14:33.139 --> 00:14:35.217
THAT'S Yujiro...!

00:14:35.241 --> 00:14:37.903
He gets so immersed...!

00:14:40.613 --> 00:14:42.809
Madam...!

00:14:51.591 --> 00:14:54.060
I win...

00:15:03.069 --> 00:15:11.069
| know that you love him more than me,
more than anyone...

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:20.696
| know that I'm making you
sad because I'm weak...

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:28.720
But if I beat him,
will you finally love me?

00:15:32.432 --> 00:15:36.130
--Love me...!
--Idiot!

00:15:52.619 --> 00:15:55.698
Just a tiny bit of your love for him...

00:15:55.722 --> 00:15:59.181
Please... Love--

00:16:12.405 --> 00:16:14.305
I'm so stupid...!

00:16:24.117 --> 00:16:27.178
Yujiro!

00:16:30.023 --> 00:16:32.701
Now you fight me!

00:16:32.725 --> 00:16:34.403
| was stunned.

00:16:34.427 --> 00:16:40.609
She challenged Mr. Yujiro
to a fight to protect him...

00:16:40.633 --> 00:16:43.762
As a true mother would!

00:17:05.291 --> 00:17:09.558
To think you'd give up
womanhood for motherhood...

00:17:25.611 --> 00:17:29.946
Wow, that's nothing special at all...

00:17:46.466 --> 00:17:49.458
What a great woman...

00:18:41.554 --> 00:18:49.554
Good night...

00:18:50.296 --> 00:18:58.296
Sleep tight...

00:19:09.048 --> 00:19:17.048
My sweet little boy...

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:32.730
Off to sleep you go...

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:45.410
Off to sleep... you go...

00:19:47.386 --> 00:19:55.386
Off to... sleep...

00:20:26.959 --> 00:20:31.106
Must've been hard on ol' Baki...

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:35.829
The moment they bonded was
the moment they parted ways...

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:41.517
While he wasn't able
to obtain that bond,

00:20:41.541 --> 00:20:45.053
Master Baki has many others.

00:20:45.077 --> 00:20:48.290
--Many others?
--Yes.

00:20:48.314 --> 00:20:50.292
Yuri Chakovsky.

00:20:50.316 --> 00:20:52.227
Hanayama Kaoru.

00:20:52.251 --> 00:20:53.896
The Yasha Ape.

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:56.732
And Gaia.

00:20:56.756 --> 00:21:01.203
He bonded with them by fighting them...

00:21:01.227 --> 00:21:07.676
And then he left on a journey to
gain the strength to overcome Yujiro.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.980
I'm sure he will form
many more bonds during it.

00:21:12.004 --> 00:21:13.749
I see...

00:21:13.773 --> 00:21:19.188
He's grown to the point where
| don't need to help him anymore...

00:21:19.212 --> 00:21:23.525
--This must remain a secret...
--Gotcha.

00:21:23.549 --> 00:21:26.075
You can have one of mine...

00:21:27.019 --> 00:21:30.455
Nah, I gave it up.

00:21:33.626 --> 00:21:37.085
--It was nice meeting you.
--Likewise.

00:21:38.197 --> 00:21:41.758
--Good night, then.
--Yeah.

00:21:42.635 --> 00:21:44.780
--Kuriyagawa-san.
--Yes?

00:21:44.804 --> 00:21:47.683
What're you gonna do now?

00:21:47.707 --> 00:21:53.339
I will simply watch everything
that has passed and will pass.

00:21:55.615 --> 00:21:58.393
So long, Baki.

00:21:58.417 --> 00:22:03.253
Well, guess I'll have me
a drink and head on home.

00:22:44.864 --> 00:22:50.412
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.436 --> 00:22:56.018
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.042 --> 00:23:01.690
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.714 --> 00:23:06.695
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.719 --> 00:23:12.234
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.258 --> 00:23:17.773
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.797 --> 00:23:23.445
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.469 --> 00:23:28.984
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.008 --> 00:23:34.656
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:40.380
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.162 --> 00:23:51.994
"Next Episode”

00:23:55.634 --> 00:23:59.981
The spirit wanders,
the wounds left in the past.

00:24:00.005 --> 00:24:05.387
The eyes fixed on the father
are no longer what they once were.

00:24:05.411 --> 00:24:10.325
At the end of the path just begun
is a light in search of strength.

00:24:10.349 --> 00:24:15.030
In search of his goal, the reborn boy
heads to the holy land of fighting.

00:24:15.054 --> 00:24:19.992
"Next Episode: Path to the Holy Land”
